        "hindi": "कतार",
        "hinglish": "kataar"
      },
      "meaning": "a line of people waiting",
      "example": "We stood in a queue for tickets.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "हम टिकट के लिए कतार में खड़े हुए।",
        "hinglish": "Hum ticket ke liye kataar mein khade hue."
      }
    },
    {
