      },
      "meaning": "to say hello to someone",
      "example": "Greet your teacher with a smile.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "मुस्कुराकर अपने टीचर का अभिवादन करो।",
        "hinglish": "Muskuraakar apne teacher ka abhivaadan karo."
      }
    },
