      },
      "meaning": "to tell someone you are happy for what they did",
      "example": "Thank the driver when you get off the bus.",
      "exampleMeaning": {
        "hi": "बस से उतरते समय ड्राइवर को धन्यवाद कहो।",
        "hinglish": "Bus se utarte samay driver ko dhanyavaad kaho."
      }
    },
